<title>JAPAN: JGB futures end down, fail to test new highs.</title>
<headline>JGB futures end down, fail to test new highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Key June Japanese government bond futures ended slightly lower after failing to test new highs earlier in the day. *Investors detected selling short- and medium-term bonds and buying long-term bonds, traders said.</p>
